# Four hundred Lola characters share the imported model while retaining separate animator instances.
# Each character root owns an AnimatorComponent; mesh children reference it through AnimatorID.
# Inspect a root animator to select a clip and edit playback; use Play for the runtime scene.
# The repeated mesh children exercise animation evaluation, skinning and repeated-geometry rendering.

